<?xml version="1.0"?>
<Plugin>
  <Information>
    <Name>WelcomeToMiddleEarth</Name>
    <Author>Thardariel, Die Bewahrer Mittelerdes; community maintenance: Dusk-92</Author>
    <Version>1.4.17-community</Version>
			<Description>Community maintenance of Thardariel's WelcomeToMiddleEarth, based on version 1.3.

- Reads untrained skill names, icons and descriptions from the game client.
- Filters normal progression against verified level milestones for the 12 current classes; keeps level-75 mounted combat and Warden gambits.
- Preserves illustrated milestones, including milestones crossed during multi-level jumps; progression continues beyond level 140.
- Level-up popup separates gained/upcoming rewards, handles multi-level jumps, keeps a race-safe skill snapshot and auto-grows to show all content when possible, with scrolling only as an overflow fallback; original 1.3 class-trait-point icon restored.
- Last detected level-up can be reopened with /wtme levelup and is saved per character, including if the plugin unloads during the short level-up debounce.
- Level-up greeting uses a protected player-name lookup. The popup keeps the native GoldWindow background; section headings, empty messages and reward rows are centered, with the original 1.3-style centered icon + caption layout.
- Full progression remains available with /wtme.
- French, English and German interface; /wtme to open.
- Official release notes reviewed through Update 49.5 (2026-09-02).

See README-FR.md and AUDIT-SOURCES.md for validation limits.
</Description>
	<Image>Dusk/WelcomeToMiddleEarth/images/the_one_ring.jpg</Image>
  </Information>
  <Package>Dusk.WelcomeToMiddleEarth.Main</Package>
  <Configuration Apartment="Dusk.WelcomeToMiddleEarth"/>
</Plugin>


